  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/4/csm_smileBasic_c5c667fc07.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "From »pilotBasic«<br>to »smileBasic«",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>From »pilotBasic«<br/>to »smileBasic«</h3> <p>The »pilotBasic« electronics with a 7-inch monitor turn »smile« devices into a »smileBasic«. You benefit from quick familiarization and fast measurement, setting, and checking of tools. The focus lies on the basic requirements of professional tool presetting: fast measurement results at the touch of a button and cutting-edge inspection with 12x magnification.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/0/csm_smleCompact_pilotStarter_0f40c1e19a.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "With »pilotStarter« to »smileCompact«",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>With »pilotStarter« to »smileCompact«</h3> <p>A »smileCompact« presetting device comes with the basic unit plus the »pilotStarter« measuring device software. This software is characterized by its simple operation and practical functions: measurement macros with tool images for quick and easy measurement, automatic detection of the cutting-edge shape and measuring range, determination and measurement of the maximum contour, and the »compass« navigation system<br/> for exact and user-independent target position positioning.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/5/csm_smileAdvance_6e07496a15.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "With »pilot 2 mT« to »smileAdvance«",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>With »pilot 2 mT« to »smileAdvance«</h3> <p>With a ZOLLER »smileAdvance« presetting and measuring machine and the »pilot 2 mT« measuring machine software, you simply get more: more measuring functions, more space thanks to a 17\" color monitor, more flexibility thanks to areas that can be customized in size, such as the cutting edge pattern, and more functions: management of your machines, setup sheets, and graphics, as well as tool data transmission in controller format to your machine.</p> </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
